          "level": "preferred",
          "summary": "Insert transition assistance, data return and certified deletion obligations into Section 14 (Termination).",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 14 ends the Hosting and Support Services but says nothing about getting our hosted data back or help moving off the Interface, and Section 13 puts the entire burden of re-hosting on us. We have added our standard exit provision: up to six months of transition assistance at TrueLink's then-current rates, return of our data in a machine-readable format within thirty days, and certified deletion thereafter. If six months is too long, we can accept ninety days of assistance provided the thirty-day data export and deletion certification stay.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0079",
              "numbering": "a.",
              "text": "Transition Assistance and Return of Client Data. Upon expiration or termination of this Agreement for any reason, TrueLink shall (i) at Client's request, provide reasonable transition assistance for up to six (6) months at TrueLink's then-current rates, including reasonable cooperation in migrating the Web Site and Client Data to Client or its designee; (ii) within thirty (30) days of Client's request, return to Client all Client Content, Credit Data and other data and information of Client or its customers stored in or processed through the Interface or the Web Site (collectively, \"Client Data\") in a commonly used, machine-readable format; and (iii) thereafter delete all Client Data from its systems and backups, except to the extent retention is required by applicable law, and certify such deletion to Client in writing."
            }
          ]
        },
